<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. A shanty of above average quality will provide a new quest. A good quality shanty will remove negative thoughts from losing someone for all participants. -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes ganham entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias. Uma cantoria acima da média dá uma nova missão. Uma de boa qualidade tira de todos os participantes os pensamentos ruins por perder alguém.</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: chanter present -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.0.label>puxador presente</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.1.label>número de participantes</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.2.label>imponência do cômodo</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Boring -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Chata</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} were incredibly boring. The cap'n displayed a lack of passion and the feeling of camaraderie just wasn't there. -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>As {0} foram um tédio. O capitão não mostrou paixão nenhuma, e a camaradagem simplesmente não apareceu.</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lame -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Fraca</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} were lame. The cap'n treated us like children, wanting so desperately to hear something to lift their spirits. -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>As {0} foram fracas. O capitão nos tratou como crianças, louco para ouvir algo que nos animasse.</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Rousing -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Empolgante</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} were very rousing. Shiver me timbers, those were some good shanties! The cap'n lifted our spirits and made us feel a camaraderie and togetherness that will only make us stronger.\n\nAnalyzing the lyrics afterwards, we found that the ancient words are actually cleverly encoded clues to a possible quest! -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>As {0} foram muito empolgantes. Raios me partam, que cantoria boa! O capitão nos animou e nos fez sentir uma camaradagem e uma união que só vão nos deixar mais fortes.\n\nAnalisando a letra depois, descobrimos que as palavras antigas são pistas habilmente codificadas de uma possível missão!</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Amazing -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Incrível</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} were amazing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the cap'n, as they reminded us of the importance of our shared camaraderie. We can even feel our sadness vanish away.\n\nAnalyzing the lyrics afterwards, we found that the ancient words are actually cleverly encoded clues to a possible quest! -->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>As {0} foram incríveis! Ainda ouvimos as palavras hipnotizantes do capitão, que nos lembraram da importância da nossa camaradagem. Dá para sentir a tristeza sumindo.\n\nAnalisando a letra depois, descobrimos que as palavras antigas são pistas habilmente codificadas de uma possível missão!</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
</LanguageData>
